  stmt_guard_err_exccode.pcpp - break step of stmt_guard.pcpp:
  exccode outside an except body (SM0615)

  How to check, from repo\bin:
    pcpp res\tests\stmt_guard_err_exccode.pcpp
    pcpp res\tests\stmt_guard_err_exccode.pcpp -t x86_64-linux-gnu
  The marked line reports that code; nothing else is reported.
